  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First stable release of the six-rule SQL Server operations inspector for EF Core 8/9/10. Preserves the alpha.2 public API and CLI options. Fixes literal NULL/DBNull defaults, makes empty-table history linear, and sends migration Console output to stderr to preserve JSON. Includes provider-generated SQL, database and package regression coverage. Inspect trusted assemblies only; raw SQL and unsupported operations require manual review.",
